leading, celebrated, popular, award-winning, landmark, cutting-edge, 
innovative, revolutionary, extraordinary, brilliant, hit, famous, renowned, 
remarkable, prestigious, world-class, respected, notable, virtuoso, honorable, 
awesome, unique, pioneering, phenomenal, prominent. 
12. Contentious labels: Value-laden labels – such as calling an organization a 
cult, an individual a racist, sexist, terrorist, or freedom fighter, or a 
sexual practice a perversion – may express contentious opinion and are best 
avoided unless widely used by reliable sources to describe the subject, in 
which case use in-text attribution. Avoid myth in its informal sense, and 
