around 1500 B.C. The article focuses on four solid gold signet rings and other 
grave goods as evidence that Mycenaean elites were influenced by, exchanged 
with, and adopted aspects of Minoan culture from Crete rather than only 
pillaging it.", "source_id": "20260728144301975480_4af19a92"}, {"id": 
