arm. It says the tomb dates to around 1500 B.C., contains more than 3,000 
burial objects including four gold signet rings, and has led UC researchers to 
argue that Minoan craftsmanship and Mycenaean cultural exchange were more 
complex than previously thought.", "source_id": 
