the published discussion of the burial describes the ring among the gold 
objects with Minoan ritual scenes or iconography.[1][2][3][4] In scholarship 
and popular reporting, the ring is discussed as part of a larger burial 
assemblage that has been used to assess Mycenaean engagement with Minoan 
